  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "E5D7268B429170E5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n欢迎你来到深钵道馆。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "E5D7258B42916F32",
      "text": "崇尚自然艺术家寇沙……\\n要挑战这个道馆馆主吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "E5D7248B42916D7F",
      "text": "那好，我带你去对战场吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "E5D7238B42916BCC",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n随时都可以告诉我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_entry_01",
      "hash64": "D3E682F755C5BFCA",
      "text": "挑战者啊！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_entry_02",
      "hash64": "D3E681F755C5BE17",
      "text": "嘿！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "C851674498B05DB7",
      "text": "来得好。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_15",
      "hash64": "C854E74498B36D0E",
      "text": "我叫寇沙，\\n是个专攻草宝可梦的艺术家，\\r\\n同时也是深钵道馆的道馆馆主。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "C851684498B05F6A",
      "text": "阁下的道馆测验，\\n我都从风车上看到了。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "C851694498B0611D",
      "text": "关于阁下那找出\\n向日花怪的洞察力……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "C851624498B05538",
      "text": "堪称前卫艺术！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "C851634498B056EB",
      "text": "我祝愿阁下在对战的时候\\n也能发挥出那股审美力。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "C851644498B0589E",
      "text": "好了，让我们合力创作\\n一个属于我们二人的艺术作品吧！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "C851654498B05A51",
      "text": "准备好了吗！？\\n塑形……开始！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kari_01",
      "hash64": "FEE39416CE8828D4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 27]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "C8515E4498B04E6C",
      "text": "真是充满艺术色彩的战术！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "C8515F4498B0501F",
      "text": "不论是招式的套路！\\n还是宝可梦的细节！\\r\\n都是精雕细琢过的！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "C854EC4498B3758D",
      "text": "如果连我们的对战\\n都称不上是艺术的话，\\r\\n那还有什么能称得上是艺术！？[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "C854EB4498B373DA",
      "text": "……我的评价结果是\\n无可挑剔的合格。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "C854EA4498B37227",
      "text": "让我把这徽章送给阁下当做证明吧！\\n想拍张合照留念也是可以的哦！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_badge",
      "hash64": "D96DC3A9668A77CF",
      "text": "有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个道馆徽章的话，\\n等级[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的宝可梦会更容易捉到，\\r\\n而且它们应该都会听阁下的话！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_badge_all",
      "hash64": "BB17EC96877279A3",
      "text": "有８个道馆徽章的话，\\n不管是什么样的宝可梦都能捉到，\\r\\n而且它们应该都会对阁下唯命是从！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_waza",
      "hash64": "F4D3E5CC9B869585",
      "text": "像阁下这样的训练家，\\n也收下我中意的这个东西吧！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "C854E94498B37074",
      "text": "啊啊，灵感涌上来了。\\n停不住……停不住啊……！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "C854E84498B36EC1",
      "text": "我要去创作新的作品，\\n就此失陪了！再会！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "E5D7228B42916A19",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n你突破了深钵道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_kusa_040_kari_02",
      "hash64": "FEE39716CE882DED",
